<title>UK: SmithKline Beecham unit sets $200 mln bond.</title>
<headline>SmithKline Beecham unit sets $200 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Citibank International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SMITHKLINE BEECHAM CAPITAL PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  SMITHKLINE BEECHAM PLC</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    30.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p>			    REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+26.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    =	   SELL CONC  =	   FULL FEES   =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.375 PCT SEPT 2001 U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
